================================================================================

PART 2: WHAT IS DESTRUCTURING?

================================================================================

Destructuring Definition

Destructuring is a JavaScript feature that extracts values from objects or arrays into variables.

Feature             | Description
--------------------|--------------------------------------------
JavaScript Feature  | Introduced with ES6
Objects             | Extract properties into variables
Arrays              | Extract values based on position
Functions           | Can destructure function parameters
Defaults            | Can provide fallback values
Renaming            | Object properties can be renamed
Rest                 | Remaining values can be captured


================================================================================

SIMPLE DESTRUCTURING EXAMPLE - NON-REACT

================================================================================

Without Destructuring
const person = {
  name: 'Alice',
  age: 25,
  city: 'NYC'
};

const name = person.name;
const age = person.age;
const city = person.city;

With Destructuring
const person = {
  name: 'Alice',
  age: 25,
  city: 'NYC'
};

const {
  name,
  age,
  city
} = person;

Result
Variable | Value
---------|---------
name     | Alice
age      | 25
city     | NYC


This:

const {
  name,
  age,
  city
} = person;


extracts the three properties and creates three variables.

Easy Memory
OBJECT
   ↓
DESTRUCTURE
   ↓
INDIVIDUAL VARIABLES


================================================================================

ARRAY DESTRUCTURING

================================================================================

Destructuring also works with arrays.

const colors = [
  'Red',
  'Green',
  'Blue'
];

const [
  firstColor,
  secondColor,
  thirdColor
] = colors;


Result:

Variable      | Value
--------------|--------
firstColor    | Red
secondColor   | Green
thirdColor    | Blue


Object destructuring works by property name, while array destructuring works by position.

Object Destructuring       | Array Destructuring
---------------------------|--------------------------
Uses property names        | Uses array positions
const { name } = person    | const [first] = colors
Order usually doesn't matter| Position matters


