HOW DESTRUCTURING WORKS IN FUNCTION PARAMETERS

================================================================================

Step 1: Component Receives Props
function Book(props) {

  // Example:
  // props = {
  //   title: 'The Great Gatsby',
  //   author: 'F. Scott Fitzgerald',
  //   price: 12.99,
  //   rating: 4.5
  // }

}

Step 2: Destructure the Props Object
function Book({
  title,
  author,
  price,
  rating
}) {

  // title  = 'The Great Gatsby'
  // author = 'F. Scott Fitzgerald'
  // price  = 12.99
  // rating = 4.5

}

Step 3: Use Variables Directly
return (
  <h2>
    {title}
  </h2>
);

Complete Flow
PARENT
  ↓
<Book
  title="The Great Gatsby"
  author="F. Scott Fitzgerald"
  price={12.99}
  rating={4.5}
/>
  ↓
PROPS OBJECT
  ↓
DESTRUCTURING
  ↓
title
author
price
rating
  ↓
JSX


