Pattern 3: Renaming Destructured Variables

================================================================================

Parent
<UserCard
  userName="Alice"
  userAge={25}
  userCity="NYC"
/>

Child
export default function UserCard({
  userName: name,
  userAge: age,
  userCity: city
}) {

  return (
    <div>

      <h2>{name}</h2>

      <p>
        Age: {age}
      </p>

      <p>
        City: {city}
      </p>

    </div>
  );
}

Renaming Syntax
Original Prop | Local Variable
--------------|----------------
userName      | name
userAge       | age
userCity      | city


Syntax:

{
  originalName: newName
}


Example:

{
  userName: name
}


means:

Read userName
     ↓
Create Local Variable
     ↓
name


