Pattern 6: Destructuring with Conditional Logic

================================================================================

export default function Book({
  title,
  author,
  price = 0,
  inStock = true,
  rating = 0
}) {

  return (
    <div>

      <h2>{title}</h2>

      <p>
        By {author}
      </p>

      <p>
        Price: ${price}
      </p>

      <p>
        {inStock
          ? '✓ In Stock'
          : '✗ Out of Stock'}
      </p>

      {rating > 4 && (
        <p>
          ⭐ Highly Rated
        </p>
      )}

    </div>
  );
}

Explanation
Code / Value       | Purpose
-------------------|----------------------------------
price = 0          | Default price
inStock = true     | Default availability
rating = 0         | Default rating
inStock ? A : B    | Conditional text
rating > 4 && ...  | Conditional JSX


