================================================================================

ONE-LINE INTERVIEW ANSWER

================================================================================

Props destructuring is JavaScript object destructuring applied to a component's Props object, allowing values such as { title, author, price } to be used directly instead of repeatedly writing props.title, props.author, and props.price. It also supports defaults, renaming, nested destructuring, and rest properties.

